-- `SolverTypes.h`, `Dimacs.h`
-- `mtl/*`, `utils/*`
-- Legacy entry points: `Main.cc`, `glucose_Main.cc` (not built by root Makefile)
-
-If you add further patches, extend this file and mention them in `NOTICE`.
